WEBVTT

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.430
It's completely autumn already.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:10.070
Yep.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.350
I suddenly feel hungry.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:15.130
Yep.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:27.240
Hey, let's eat some!

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:30.070
Snacking on the way home isn't good for you.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:31.190
But...

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:33.850
I know.

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.010
Let's buy it as a present.

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:39.380
Present?

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:59.000
Say, do you have anyone you like, Yoshino?

00:00:59.590 --> 00:01:03.120
Eh? How did it come to this topic?

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.760
Huh? I think it's...

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:10.440
The topic was "Uchida wants to find a boyfriend".

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:12.260
There was no such topic!

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:14.150
Really...

00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:17.960
The kind of information that you should listen to is... this!

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:21.880
Rules of Attraction?

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:24.940
Is it useful?

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:27.210
It's not a matter of whether it’s useful or not.

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:29.040
It has been elevated to the status of a rule.

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:30.030
That's the law.

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:33.950
If you don't follow the law. It is a sin.

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:35.370
Sin?

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:39.380
If you committed a sin and got punished, that wouldn't be good.

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:41.150
Punishment...

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:48.480
And so, the first law.

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:51.600
To show a lack of strength, let's start practicing.

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.220
Roger, Sensei!

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:54.720
And so, Uchida-kun.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:55.670
Yes!

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:56.560
Yoshino-kun.

00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:57.730
Yes!

00:01:57.730 --> 00:02:00.380
Go take the soft drinks out from the fridge.

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:01.900
Yes!

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:10.860
Use this can to practice that lack of strength.

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:12.790
There are so many cans.

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:15.540
If there aren't any carbonated drinks, Chiaki will get mad.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.680
So then, let's start with Uchida-kun.

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:18.790
Okay!

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.950
Okay...

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:40.810
I opened it accidentally.

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:41.830
You suck!

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.440
But...

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.990
Since Touma and Chiaki have gone to buy stuff and aren't around...

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:53.170
Yoshino would probably be better at this.

00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:55.840
Let me try.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:27.810
T-There is that feeling of wanting to help her open the can.

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:31.360
Helping her open the can could be one of the correct methods.

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:36.080
Don't make that "I've done well" expression!

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:38.200
I'm back.

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:40.200
Welcome back.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:42.950
Sorry for the intrusion!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.400
I'm here, Kana-chan.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:46.850
Ah! Maki-chan, you came at the right time.

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:50.050
Showing weakness?

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:52.320
Please show an example.

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:53.860
Example, huh.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:59.810
I used to do it too...

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:13.150
I can't open it!

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.430
Can you help me open it?

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:17.580
You can't open it?

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:18.700
Then I can't either.

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:20.620
What was that?!

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:23.080
You recalled an unpleasant incident?

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:27.330
For this kind of thing, Atsuko would be better.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:28.980
Atsuko!

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:31.670
Here.

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:03.000
Oh!

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.220
Oh!

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:23.250
I'm sorry Maki, I can't open it.

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:24.430
Please help?

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:28.480
She's... good.

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:42.950
Regarding Atsuko, I feel that she doesn't need to use such tricks.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:48.290
Yeah, she doesn't need to act like she's weak.

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:52.920
A witch!

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:54.190
A witch, you say?!

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:04.350
What's the matter, Atsuko?

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:08.050
They told me to help open a can.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:09.600
I couldn't open it.

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:11.930
It's a lie!

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:17.860
But she said that she really can't open it.

00:06:17.860 --> 00:06:19.150
That's a lie! Witch!

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:20.110
Witch!

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:22.060
I'm back.

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:27.020
Chiaki, welcome back.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:29.870
Hey! That's my carbonated drink!

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:34.670
Really.

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:42.890
What is this?

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:48.020
It's the work of the witch.

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:50.640
Who is the witch?

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.530
You children are in luck.

00:08:32.130 --> 00:08:35.270
Today, we have two professionals on the topic of guys.

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:37.070
Let's learn a lot from them.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:38.590
Okay!

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:40.280
This is Maki-sensei.

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:43.000
Oh? Thank you.

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:47.240
I wish for you girls live proper adolescent lives.

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:48.560
Sensei!

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:51.490
And to answer your request...

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:54.190
Let me teach you how to handle men.

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:56.550
But, there are day and night time activities.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:59.150
Sensei, you're really fired up! Sensei!

00:08:59.450 --> 00:09:00.650
And without further delay.

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:02.560
Maki...

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:05.590
Help me prepare dinner.

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:08.160
Wait a sec, I was just getting to the good part!

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:08.660
Come. Quickly.

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:12.090
Haruka, I'm the teacher!

00:09:15.140 --> 00:09:18.510
Uh... Maki-sensei had an urgent matter to attend to.

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:20.130
Instead, here is her replacement.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:22.250
Atsuko-sensei.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:31.920
Quickly, if you guys have anything you want to ask her, please do so.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:35.770
Let's talk about what was mentioned before, the part about night time.

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:38.400
What is your answer, sensei?

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:43.030
What is your answer, sensei?

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:46.090
That...

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:55.550
That... Uh... Uh...

00:09:57.540 --> 00:09:59.960
Stop it Kana, she is clearly troubled by it.

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:03.500
What's with that, Touma?

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:06.840
If you're bored, you can go play soccer with Fujioka.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.590
It's not about soccer every day, idiot.

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:14.100
I-Idiot?  What's with that "idiot"?! Get out!

00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:15.430
I won't leave!

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:17.270
I said to leave!

00:10:17.270 --> 00:10:19.650
No, I won't! You can just leave!

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:21.950
What the...! You!

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:25.050
You're going too far.

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:26.650
Uh...

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:42.790
Uh...

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:45.250
Uh...

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:47.030
Eh?

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:52.780
Fell asleep?

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:56.310
That seems like a very blissful sleep.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:11:02.940
Uh, is this a boy or a girl?

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:06.020
Look carefully, children.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:09.030
To calm violent males, hugging them is all you need to do.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.330
That is what sensei has demonstrated.

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.060
Yes!

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:15.360
A guy?!

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:17.120
Just as expected of sensei.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.830
There are just some things we can't do.

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:19.980
Just as expected.

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:21.170
Just as expected!

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:31.970
Yesterday was fun.

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:33.680
I guess...

00:11:34.430 --> 00:11:37.460
But halfway through, I stopped remembering anything.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:39.510
Because Touma fell asleep.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.940
Really?

00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:43.000
Ahh... I need to go to the toilet.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:43.900
Toilet!

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:45.650
Toilet!

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:54.870
Erm, Touma, I'm sorry. It wasn't on purpose.

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:08.380
Men become quiet when they get hit too.

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.320
Hey, Keiko.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:32.860
What do you need to do in order to get a boyfriend?

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:36.030
Hmm? What's wrong, asking so suddenly?

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:38.490
Nothing...

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.090
And then, yesterday's match was great!

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:48.090
Yeah!

00:12:49.710 --> 00:12:52.680
You may just find a boyfriend where you least expect it.

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:53.900
Eh? What's with that?

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:54.570
Eh?

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:04.760
Really! It's not because I want a boyfriend that I asked.

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:09.610
It was because I wanted to hear some amusing reply, that's why I asked!

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:17.220
Keiko, you're only quoting a standard, neutral answer, aren't you?

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:19.260
Zero points!

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:24.250
Does anyone have an amusing reply?

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.140
Who do you think you are?!

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:33.970
If you wanted an interesting reply, you should have said so.

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:38.130
Keiko!

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:41.480
What is it?

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:44.770
Erm, I'm not talking about myself, but...

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:50.980
A friend called A-san, was suddenly hugged from behind by B-kun, whom she loved.

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:54.110
What do you think caused this?

00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.210
Hey?

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:06.390
A certain A-san, was hugged from behind suddenly by B-kun, whom she loved.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:10.050
Hey...

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.300
That A-san...

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:24.700
I need to make it interesting.

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:31.640
B-kun had a one-sided love for C-san.

00:14:32.090 --> 00:14:34.860
What do you think you need to do to get a boyfriend?

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:41.370
Minami, you might find such a person near you.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:46.200
B-kun made C-san angry.

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:48.060
It isn't interesting!

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:50.870
B-kun was pushed.

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:55.020
B-kun, who was pushed, accidentally hugged A-san.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:15:00.040
It wasn't interesting?

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:26.680
Can't anyone give me an interesting answer?

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:32.750
Hey, Kana.

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:36.720
There is something I would like to ask.

00:15:36.720 --> 00:15:38.090
What is it?

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:43.510
A-san was hugged from behind suddenly by B-kun.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.970
How do you think it happened?

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:53.010
Um...

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:04.950
I think it's just the joys of being youthful.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.290
Do you think that is a perfect answer to the question?

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:11.950
Eh, no...

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:14.290
This game's rules are confusing.

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.740
For example:

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:19.870
Is it fine if C-san entered the fray?

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:21.810
C-san?

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:23.090
Yes, C-san.

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:25.540
What kind of person is C-san?

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:28.850
A-A very good person.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:38.120
Um...

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.820
I'm not feeling well...

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:42.760
Test me another day, okay?

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:46.060
Even though you told me off earlier!

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.120
Who the hell do you think you are?!

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:38.170
All right.

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:40.770
Let's take a break!

00:18:49.050 --> 00:18:49.920
Atsuko.

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:53.800
Yes? What is it?

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:55.250
Have you seen Hayami?

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:58.500
No, I haven't seen her today.

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:00.490
Hmm, I see.

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:13.510
Hosaka-senpai seems cooler if he keeps his mouth shut.

00:19:13.890 --> 00:19:15.310
It can't be helped.

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:18.420
I wanted to talk to her about the training schedules.

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:19.850
Sorry to have troubled you.

00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:21.260
It's fine.

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:24.610
Atsuko.

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:25.780
Yes?

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:29.400
The serve just now was a spectacle.

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:32.310
Thank you very much.

00:19:36.530 --> 00:19:37.620
Atsuko!

00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:40.030
Atsuko, are you all right?

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:42.080
Eh? What is?

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:45.440
Did Hosaka-senpai do anything disgusting to you?

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:47.830
No...

00:19:48.890 --> 00:19:50.340
That's a relief.

00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:52.910
Housaka-senpai, morning.

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:54.230
Oh, Natsuki.

00:19:54.230 --> 00:19:55.280
Did you just come?

00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:56.450
Yes.

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:58.160
It's not good to be late.

00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:59.060
Sorry.

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:02.650
As a punishment, pick up all the balls lying around.

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:03.760
Yes.

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:05.610
Hey, Maki.

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:06.440
Yeah?

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:09.450
Do you hate Hosaka-senpai?

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:11.490
Eh? Why?

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:12.930
I sort of feel it.

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:16.270
It's not hate. It's just that he disgusts me.

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:20.250
It's just as Hayami-senpai says.

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:22.650
Why did you ask me such a question anyway?

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:24.630
That?

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:28.230
How do you think of him?

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:29.300
How?

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:33.840
Don't tell me... you like Hosaka-sempai?

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:38.900
You're joking, right?

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:39.520
Yup.

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:43.210
Hey, both of you.

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:45.240
Hayami-senpai.

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:46.890
What are you talking about?

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:49.810
Er.. that is...

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:51.400
Something interesting?

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:53.070
Then I want to join in too.

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:56.540
Senpai.

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:58.970
Yes?

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:00.560
I picked up the balls.

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:02.750
I see. Thank you for the hard work.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.710
Then, I need to go soon.

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:05.610
What is the matter?

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:07.720
I need to make food.

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:10.050
I see, I understand.

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:12.030
Then, I take my leave.

00:21:12.030 --> 00:21:13.040
Thanks for the hard work.

00:21:18.850 --> 00:21:19.480
Hayami.

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:21.760
Are both of you doing all right?

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:25.730
Then, what were you talking about?

00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:28.670
U-Uh, that...

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:32.510
H-He's coming over!

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:35.130
What is the matter?

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:37.500
U-Uh, nothing.

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:41.450
Speaking of which, about Haruka-chan...

00:21:42.790 --> 00:21:45.540
Did you guys try to persuade her to join?

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:49.540
About that... Haruka is very busy at home.

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:53.590
Hmm... Then ask her to help us for the time being, please.

00:21:53.590 --> 00:21:56.710
Minami Haruka... in our Volleyball club.

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:03.270
Here I come, Minami Haruka!

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:05.760
Okay! Please!

00:22:06.490 --> 00:22:08.280
Here!

00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:16.200
Sorry, Hosaka-sempai.

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:18.240
Don't mind it, Minami Haruka.

00:22:18.860 --> 00:22:21.160
I put too much strength into that serve.

00:22:21.160 --> 00:22:24.060
As expected of Hosaka-senpai.

00:22:28.640 --> 00:22:30.430
Hosaka-senpai!

00:22:31.850 --> 00:22:33.380
There's so much sweat.

00:22:34.010 --> 00:22:35.260
Let me help you wipe it off.

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:40.010
Sorry for the trouble, Minami Haruka.

00:22:41.650 --> 00:22:43.320
You're welcome.

00:22:44.950 --> 00:22:46.910
I can't reach...

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:49.770
Let me bend down a little.

00:22:53.250 --> 00:22:54.320
Please help me with here too.

00:22:55.130 --> 00:22:56.070
Not there.

00:22:56.430 --> 00:22:57.800
Hmm...

00:22:58.750 --> 00:23:00.030
Sickening.

00:23:00.030 --> 00:23:02.300
Ah, there he goes again.

00:23:02.300 --> 00:23:04.140
It really can't be helped.

00:23:04.140 --> 00:23:06.220
Let's go, Atsuko.

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:13.770
Oh... It's Hayami.

00:23:13.770 --> 00:23:14.980
Say...

00:23:14.980 --> 00:23:15.560
What's the matter?

00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:17.560
It's about the training plan that you proposed.

00:23:17.560 --> 00:23:17.880
Hmm.

00:23:17.880 --> 00:23:19.940
It could be good, but...

00:23:19.940 --> 00:23:23.510
Everyone has painstakingly shown improvement.

00:23:23.810 --> 00:23:25.500
Train them more seriously.

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:29.010
